{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Sent thus.</b> According to this reckoning — and what is the reckoning? <b>Ten donkeys, etc.</b>" "<b>Of the best of Egypt.</b> We find in the Talmud that he sent him aged wine, for the disposition of elders is pleased by it; and the midrash aggadah — parched fava beans." "<b>בר ולחם.</b> As its Targum renders." "<b>And מזון.</b> Provisions."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:37.741440544Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}